OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening with some bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells to end the day. Remaining dry
OL,8,Fovernight with variable cloud and some
OL,9,Fclear spells. Turning quite chilly in
OL,10,Fsome sheltered rural spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,13,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Light winds and becoming very
OL,15,Fwarm.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,18,Fvery warm period with a good deal of
OL,19,Fdry and bright weather. There will
OL,20,Falso be the chance of some showery
OL,21,Fbursts of rain which could be heavy.
